{"seq":2,"slug":"parallel-execution","title":"并行执行策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/reliability/parallel-execution","wordCount":1306,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"并行执行策略\">并行执行策略</h1><p>E2E 测试套件从 10 个用例增长到 500 个后，串行执行时间从 5 分钟膨胀到 4 小时——远超开发者可接受的反馈周期。并行执行是将测试时间从线性增长压缩为对数增长的关键技术，但它引入了隔离性、资源竞争、调试困难等新问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Worker 并行</strong>：Playwright 通过独立进程（Worker）并行执行测试，每个 Worker 拥有独立浏览器实例</li>\n<li><strong>Sharding（分片）</strong>：将测试分发到多台机器并行运行，突破单机资源瓶颈</li>\n<li><strong>Browser Context 隔离</strong>：同一浏览器的独立上下文，Cookie/Storage 天然隔离，启动开销小</li>\n<li><strong>时间感知分片</strong>：基于历史执行时间分配测试到各分片，确保各分片耗时均衡</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"并行模型\">并行模型</h2><h3 id=\"playwright-的并行架构\">Playwright 的并行架构</h3><p>Playwright 使用 Worker 进程并行执行测试，每个 Worker 拥有独立的浏览器实例：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Playwright Test Runner] --&gt; B[Worker 1]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Worker 2]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Worker 3]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Worker N]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[Browser Context 1]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[Browser Context 2]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Browser Context 3]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Browser Context 4]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Browser Context 5]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[Browser Context N]\">graph TD\n    A[Playwright Test Runner] --&gt; B[Worker 1]\n    A --&gt; C[Worker 2]\n    A --&gt; D[Worker 3]\n    A --&gt; E[Worker N]\n    B --&gt; B1[Browser Context 1]\n    B --&gt; B2[Browser Context 2]\n    C --&gt; C1[Browser Context 3]\n    C --&gt; C2[Browser Context 4]\n    D --&gt; D1[Browser Context 5]\n    E --&gt; E1[Browser Context N]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离层级</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>隔离程度</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Worker 进程级</td>\n<td>独立进程 + 独立浏览器</td>\n<td>完全隔离</td>\n<td>启动开销大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Browser Context 级</td>\n<td>同一浏览器的独立上下文</td>\n<td>Cookie/Storage 隔离</td>\n<td>启动快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试文件级</td>\n<td>同一文件内的测试串行</td>\n<td>无隔离</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"配置并行度\">配置并行度</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// playwright.config.ts&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  // Worker 数量&#10;  workers: process.env.CI ? 4 : undefined, // CI 固定 4，本地用 CPU 核数&#10;&#10;  // 每个文件内部是否并行&#10;  fullyParallel: true, // true = 文件内测试也并行&#10;&#10;  // 并发浏览器上下文限制&#10;  use: {&#10;    // 每个测试获得独立上下文&#10;    contextOptions: {/* ... */},&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// playwright.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Worker 数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  workers: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CI 固定 4，本地用 CPU 核数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 每个文件内部是否并行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fullyParallel: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// true = 文件内测试也并行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 并发浏览器上下文限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  use: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 每个测试获得独立上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    contextOptions: {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* ... */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"并行度与时间的关系\">并行度与时间的关系</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>parallel</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>serial</mtext></msub><mi>W</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{parallel}} \\approx \\frac{T_{\\text{serial}}}{W} + T_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parallel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">serial</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是 Worker 数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 包括进程启动、浏览器初始化和资源竞争开销。实际加速比通常在 60-80% 的理论值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Worker 数</th>\n<th>理论加速比</th>\n<th>实际加速比（100 个测试）</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2x</td>\n<td>1.7x</td>\n<td>进程启动开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4x</td>\n<td>3.0x</td>\n<td>资源竞争加剧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8x</td>\n<td>4.5x</td>\n<td>I/O 瓶颈和 CPU 争用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>16x</td>\n<td>5.0x</td>\n<td>收益递减明显</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sharding-分片\">Sharding（分片）</h2><p>当单机并行到达瓶颈时，Sharding 将测试分发到多台机器：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[CI Pipeline] --&gt; B[Shard 1/4: 测试 1-125]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Shard 2/4: 测试 126-250]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Shard 3/4: 测试 251-375]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Shard 4/4: 测试 376-500]&#10;    B --&gt; F[结果合并]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph LR\n    A[CI Pipeline] --&gt; B[Shard 1/4: 测试 1-125]\n    A --&gt; C[Shard 2/4: 测试 126-250]\n    A --&gt; D[Shard 3/4: 测试 251-375]\n    A --&gt; E[Shard 4/4: 测试 376-500]\n    B --&gt; F[结果合并]\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><h3 id=\"分片配置\">分片配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CI 中的分片运行&#10;npx playwright test --shard=1/4&#10;npx playwright test --shard=2/4&#10;npx playwright test --shard=3/4&#10;npx playwright test --shard=4/4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 中的分片运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> playwright</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --shard=1/4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> playwright</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --shard=2/4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> playwright</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --shard=3/4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> playwright</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --shard=4/4</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 矩阵策略&#10;jobs:&#10;  test:&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        shard: [1, 2, 3, 4]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - run: npx playwright test --shard=${{ matrix.shard }}/4&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          name: test-results-${{ matrix.shard }}&#10;          path: test-results/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 矩阵策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        shard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx playwright test --shard=${{ matrix.shard }}/4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/upload-artifact@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test-results-${{ matrix.shard }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test-results/</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分片策略对比\">分片策略对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>分配方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均匀分片</td>\n<td>按文件数等分</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>各分片时间可能不均</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间感知分片</td>\n<td>按历史执行时间分配</td>\n<td>分片时间均衡</td>\n<td>需要维护执行时间数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签分片</td>\n<td>按功能域/优先级分组</td>\n<td>可选择性运行</td>\n<td>需要手动标记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"隔离策略\">隔离策略</h2><p>并行执行的最大风险是测试间的状态干扰。关键隔离层：</p>\n<h3 id=\"浏览器状态隔离\">浏览器状态隔离</h3><p>Playwright 的 Browser Context 天然提供：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>独立的 Cookie 和 Storage</li>\n<li>独立的 Cache</li>\n<li>独立的 Service Worker 注册</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"test.describe.configure({ mode: &#39;parallel&#39; }); // 文件内并行&#10;&#10;test(&#39;测试 A&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;  // page 自动关联独立的 context，与测试 B 隔离&#10;});&#10;&#10;test(&#39;测试 B&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;  // 完全独立的浏览器状态&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">test.describe.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">configure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ mode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'parallel'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 文件内并行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'测试 A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // page 自动关联独立的 context，与测试 B 隔离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'测试 B'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 完全独立的浏览器状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据层隔离\">数据层隔离</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离方案</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>唯一标识符</td>\n<td>每个测试使用唯一 email/ID</td>\n<td>大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>租户隔离</td>\n<td>每个 Worker 对应一个租户</td>\n<td>多租户系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库事务</td>\n<td>每个测试包裹在回滚事务中</td>\n<td>后端集成测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立实例</td>\n<td>每个 Shard 对应独立服务实例</td>\n<td>完全隔离（最贵）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"共享资源竞争\">共享资源竞争</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[并行测试] --&gt; B{共享资源?}&#10;    B --&gt;|数据库| C[唯一标识符 + 命名空间]&#10;    B --&gt;|文件系统| D[Worker 专属临时目录]&#10;    B --&gt;|端口| E[动态端口分配]&#10;    B --&gt;|第三方 API| F[Mock/限流]&#10;    B --&gt;|全局状态| G[避免或加锁]\">graph TD\n    A[并行测试] --&gt; B{共享资源?}\n    B --&gt;|数据库| C[唯一标识符 + 命名空间]\n    B --&gt;|文件系统| D[Worker 专属临时目录]\n    B --&gt;|端口| E[动态端口分配]\n    B --&gt;|第三方 API| F[Mock/限流]\n    B --&gt;|全局状态| G[避免或加锁]</pre><h2 id=\"执行优化\">执行优化</h2><h3 id=\"慢测试优先调度\">慢测试优先调度</h3><p>将执行时间最长的测试优先分配给 Worker，避免出现一个 Worker 在最后等待最慢的测试完成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// playwright.config.ts&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  // 按文件执行时间排序（需要历史数据）&#10;  reporter: [[&#39;json&#39;, { outputFile: &#39;.playwright-times.json&#39; }]],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// playwright.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 按文件执行时间排序（需要历史数据）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reporter: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { outputFile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.playwright-times.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"资源管理\">资源管理</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>限制建议</th>\n<th>超出后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>Worker 数 ≤ CPU 核数</td>\n<td>上下文切换开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>每个 Worker ~500MB</td>\n<td>OOM 导致随机失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘 I/O</td>\n<td>SSD 优先</td>\n<td>视频/截图写入瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络</td>\n<td>限制外部请求并行度</td>\n<td>第三方限流触发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选择性运行\">选择性运行</h3><p>不是每次 CI 都需要运行全部测试：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>运行范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>影响分析</td>\n<td>基于 Git diff 确定受影响的测试</td>\n<td>仅相关测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签过滤</td>\n<td><code>--grep @smoke</code></td>\n<td>冒烟测试子集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败优先</td>\n<td>上次失败的测试先跑</td>\n<td>快速确认修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量</td>\n<td>发布前或定时</td>\n<td>所有测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 只运行标记为 smoke 的测试&#10;npx playwright test --grep @smoke&#10;&#10;# 只运行上次失败的测试&#10;npx playwright test --last-failed\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只运行标记为 smoke 的测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> playwright</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @smoke</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只运行上次失败的测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> playwright</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --last-failed</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"调试并行失败\">调试并行失败</h2><p>并行环境中的失败更难调试。关键技巧：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>诊断方法</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只在并行时失败</td>\n<td><code>--workers=1</code> 对比串行</td>\n<td>查找共享状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特定 Shard 失败</td>\n<td>检查 Shard 间资源差异</td>\n<td>隔离数据或环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间歇性失败</td>\n<td>Trace + 视频回放</td>\n<td><code>trace: &#39;retain-on-failure&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源耗尽</td>\n<td>监控 CPU/内存/连接数</td>\n<td>降低并行度或增加资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无限增加 Worker</td>\n<td>资源争用导致更多 Flaky</td>\n<td>找到最优并行度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试间共享全局变量</td>\n<td>竞态条件</td>\n<td>每个测试独立数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略分片不均衡</td>\n<td>总时间取决于最慢分片</td>\n<td>时间感知分片策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行测试访问同一账号</td>\n<td>状态冲突</td>\n<td>每个 Worker 独立账号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不收集 Trace</td>\n<td>无法回溯并行失败</td>\n<td>失败时保留 Trace</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>并行执行的核心是在加速反馈的同时维持隔离性——Worker 级进程隔离保证浏览器状态独立，唯一标识符保证数据不冲突，Sharding 突破单机瓶颈。实际加速比通常在理论值的 60-80%，收益递减点大约在 CPU 核数附近。并行失败的调试依赖 Trace 和串行复现。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>同章参考</strong>：<a href=\"flaky-test-management\">Flaky 测试治理</a> 中的并发冲突是并行化引入的主要 Flaky 来源；<a href=\"test-environment-management\">测试环境管理</a> 为并行执行提供资源隔离的基础设施。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并行执行策略","id":"并行执行策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"并行模型","id":"并行模型"},{"level":3,"text":"Playwright 的并行架构","id":"playwright-的并行架构"},{"level":3,"text":"配置并行度","id":"配置并行度"},{"level":3,"text":"并行度与时间的关系","id":"并行度与时间的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"Sharding（分片）","id":"sharding-分片"},{"level":3,"text":"分片配置","id":"分片配置"},{"level":3,"text":"分片策略对比","id":"分片策略对比"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离策略","id":"隔离策略"},{"level":3,"text":"浏览器状态隔离","id":"浏览器状态隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"数据层隔离","id":"数据层隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"共享资源竞争","id":"共享资源竞争"},{"level":2,"text":"执行优化","id":"执行优化"},{"level":3,"text":"慢测试优先调度","id":"慢测试优先调度"},{"level":3,"text":"资源管理","id":"资源管理"},{"level":3,"text":"选择性运行","id":"选择性运行"},{"level":2,"text":"调试并行失败","id":"调试并行失败"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Flaky 测试治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/reliability/flaky-test-management"},"next":{"title":"测试环境管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/reliability/test-environment-management"}}